		{"id":"4a6bc49a56caf02d","type":"text","text":"# **Cash Flow Statement**\n\nIdentifies the sources and uses of cash during a period and explains the change in the cash balance reported on the balance sheet.\n\n\n\n\n","x":-1200,"y":-1000,"width":560,"height":172},
