		{"id":"0d25b538009b607c","type":"text","text":"# **Operating Activities**\n\n* Goods and services sales (inflow)\n* Paying for operating expenses (outflow)\n* inflows and outflows from changes in accounts receivable and accounts payable.\n* Borrowing or repayment of supplier debt\n\n","x":-1200,"y":-773,"width":494,"height":232,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"da68fa71327bb5c9","type":"text","text":"# **Investing Activities**\n\n* Purchase or sale of PP&E\n* Cash outflow for an acquisition\n\n","x":-1200,"y":-520,"width":494,"height":180,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"3228015dedd1279c","type":"text","text":"# **Financing Activities**\n\n* Borrowing long term debt\n* Issuing equity securities\n* Repurchases of shares\n* Payment of dividends\n\n","x":-1200,"y":-320,"width":494,"height":180,"color":"5"}
